/2221500/extras/a96b1e37051f040ceb8007732ea23db6.mp4?t=1730124471\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">During the game, you may witness some mysterious happenings surrounding the buffet and its local, through the conversations with the customers, through your humble radio and television, or with your own eyes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2221500/extras/8998a2ac5c85196f76fb2173a2c5a50c.poster.avif?t=1730124471\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2221500/extras/8998a2ac5c85196f76fb2173a2c5a50c.webm?t=1730124471\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2221500/extras/8998a2ac5c85196f76fb2173a2c5a50c.mp4?t=1730124471\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Retro PS1-inspired visuals</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Randomized events and customer orders</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Detailed toast-making system with temperature and rot</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Management of the shop with a sell-buy cycle, and cleaning</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Exotic, unique, and intriguing storyline</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Multiple endings </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> No jump scares </p></li></ul>",
